    "content": "# CCR-005 rollout audit — 2026-07-28\n\n## Verdict\n\n`APPLIED_WITH_FG-001_STILL_BLOCKING`\n\nReviewer approval was explicit: `APPROVE CCR-005`. The approved contract change is\neffective as baseline `PC-2026.3`. No application ticket, source module or runtime claim\nwas opened.\n\n## Delivered\n\n- machine-readable 55-row backlog-to-contract registry and locked schema;\n- explicit Core Required/Core Optional/Stretch/Post-MVP dispositions;\n- canonical ownership/resource paths;\n- provider-neutral payment boundary, payOS adapter and deterministic fake policy;\n- product, architecture, API, data, event, security and quality amendments;\n- Staff post-MVP and AI stretch routes;\n- validator invariants, five registry mutations and one sensitive-log negative fixture;\n- corrected backlog priority total: 46 Must, 6 Should, 3 Could.\n\n## Verification\n\nCommand: `node tools/control-plane/validate-control-plane.mjs`\nWorking directory: repository root\nEnvironment: local Windows/Node, no application runtime\nExit code: `0`\nObservation: control plane passed, endpoint registry `55/55`, negative fixtures passed.\n\nLimitations:\n\n- validation proves document/control-plane consistency, not implemented APIs;\n- no application package/tooling exists, so application tests remain `NOT_RUN`;\n- Foundation Gate `FG-001` still has no reviewer-observed evidence.\n\n## Next action\n\nReview Foundation Gate evidence for `FG-001`.\n\nCompletion condition: reviewer records `VERIFIED` or explicit findings from observed\nevidence. Until then `TKT-W04-D01` remains candidate-only.\n"
