    "content": "# Repository Reconciliation Report — TKT-W04-D01 Startup\n\nStatus: `COMPLETED`\n\n**Date:** 2026-07-28\n**Authorized Ticket:** `TKT-W04-D01`\n**Stage:** `STARTUP`\n**Effective Baseline:** `PC-2026.3`\n\n---\n\n## 1. Authorization Evidence\n\n- **Foundation Gate `FG-001` Status:** `VERIFIED`\n- **Review Record:** [AI-contracts/audits/2026-07-28-foundation-gate-review.md](file:///d:/back-end/EDUCATION-BACKEND/MovieTicketBookingApp/AI-contracts/audits/2026-07-28-foundation-gate-review.md)\n- **Final Rubric Score:** `12/12` (Problem Framing 3/3, Design 3/3, Verification 3/3, Explanation 3/3).\n- **Observed Positive Evidence:** PostgreSQL 16 Server (`postgres-lab:5432`), 2 distinct backend process sessions (`PID 83` & `PID 84`), real overlapping transaction lock contention barrier (`Client B pending while Client A uncommitted`), PostgreSQL `SQLSTATE 23505 unique_violation`, exact expiry equality boundary (`now >= expires_at`), seat reuse after `EXPIRED`/`CANCELLED`, and confirmed-seat invariant (`12/12` tests passing).\n- **Observed Negative Evidence:** Missing connection environment variables (`PG_URI` / `DATABASE_URL`) triggers non-zero exit (`exit code 1`) before database access, displaying generic placeholder `<postgresql-connection-uri>`.\n- **Credential Scan Evidence:** Regex scan across lab scripts, audit records, and context files returned `0 matches` for plaintext credentials.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Observed Repository Snapshot\n\n- **Branch:** `main`\n- **HEAD Commit:** `099d664` (\"Update session log: record initial baseline commits\")\n- **Worktree State:** `MODIFIED` (contains control-plane contracts, audit reviews, `package.json`, and PostgreSQL lab harness artifacts `tools/labs/verify_lab.sql` & `tools/labs/run_lab.mjs`).\n- **Services Running:** Real PostgreSQL 16 Docker Container `postgres-lab` published on `localhost:5432`.\n- **Application Codebase:** `NOT_SCAFFOLDED` (Application source modules are not yet created).\n- **Application Test Suite:** `NOT_RUN` (No application tooling or application code exists yet).\n\n---\n\n## 3. Canonical State & Projection Alignment\n\n- **Canonical State File:** [AI-contracts/state/current-work.yml](file:///d:/back-end/EDUCATION-BACKEND/MovieTicketBookingApp/AI-contracts/state/current-work.yml) (`current_stage: STARTUP`, `ticket_id: TKT-W04-D01`, `candidate_ticket_id: TKT-W04-D02`).\n- **Compatibility Projections:** [AI-contracts/state/current-ticket.yml](file:///d:/back-end/EDUCATION-BACKEND/MovieTicketBookingApp/AI-contracts/state/current-ticket.yml), [AI-contracts/state/next-action.yml](file:///d:/back-end/EDUCATION-BACKEND/MovieTicketBookingApp/AI-contracts/state/next-action.yml), and [CODEX-CONTEXT.md](file:///d:/back-end/EDUCATION-BACKEND/MovieTicketBookingApp/CODEX-CONTEXT.md) are synchronized.\n- **Active Blockers:** `[]` (0 active blockers remaining).\n- **Control-Plane Validation:** `node tools/control-plane/validate-control-plane.mjs` returns `PASSED` with exit code `0`.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Transition Condition & Next Action\n\nRepository reconciliation for `TKT-W04-D01` at stage `STARTUP` is fully **`COMPLETED`**.\nThe ticket is ready to advance to the `LEARNING` stage for Learning Gate `LG-TKT-W04-D01`.\n\n- **Next Action:** `ADVANCE_TO_LEARNING`\n- **Target:** `LG-TKT-W04-D01`\n"
