    "content": "# Stretch AI route\n\nStatus: `NOT_AUTHORIZED_FOR_MVP`\nSource: CCR-005; `API-AI-001..010`\n\nAll ten AI endpoints are contracted as `STRETCH`; no current MVP ticket maps to them.\nThey may be proposed only after all core release blockers are clear. A future reviewed\nroute must decide ownership and introduce capability/tickets for:\n\n1. Semantic search and embedding lifecycle.\n2. Recommendation, preference and feedback privacy.\n3. Admin drafting/apply workflow, human approval and provenance.\n4. Abuse/cost limits, prompt injection/data-egress controls, usage/audit retention.\n\nContract presence is not implementation permission and does not count toward MVP release.\n"
